    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Wildcards are proficient with simple weapons, as well as with longbows, longswords, all martial throwing weapons, and all martial weapons that are compatible with the Weapon Finesse feat. Armor Proficiency: Wildcards are proficient with light armor and shields, but not tower shields.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wildcard#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
